'''Sartan Civil War''' may refer to either of two civil wars in Sarta's history:

* [[First Sartan Civil War]] — the 1738–1747 civil war, covered in [[History of Sarta (1705-1747)]].
* [[Second Sartan Civil War]] — the 1799–1811 civil war, covered in [[History of Sarta (1747-1811)]].

